/* ============================================
   DSA SHEET — curated interview problem list
   Source: "DSA Sheet by Arsh (45 Days Plan)" + "FINAL450" (both TSVs in the repo root),
   plus 7 problems that were LeetCode day-topics in the AI + Full-Stack roadmap
   (contains-duplicate, valid-anagram, valid-palindrome, longest-substring-no-repeat,
   permutations, number-of-provinces, lfu-cache).
   Deduplicated; theory-only rows, dead links and low-value competitive-programming
   problems were dropped.

   ORDER MATTERS — js/dsa.js schedules problems in array order. Topics follow the usual
   dependency order: Arrays/Strings → Two Pointers → Stack → Binary Search → Sliding Window
   → Linked List → Trees → Tries → Heaps → Backtracking → Graphs → 1-D DP → Greedy/Intervals
   → 2-D DP → Hards; Math & Bits (low interview value) come late.
     DSA_FOUNDATION  → Months 01–05: light practice, Easy first, most important first
     DSA_INTERVIEW   → Month 06 onward: Mediums grouped by pattern, then a Hard round
   `id` is the progress key (stored in profile setting `dsa_progress`) — never rename one.
   `star` = must-do for interviews.
   ============================================ */

